/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Computer Vision is a rapidly growing field that enables machines to interpret and process visual information. One of its foundations is digital image processing, which involves manipulating images to improve quality, extract features, and prepare them for advanced tasks such as recognition and classification.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
