/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project presents an Interactive Image Processing Toolkit developed using Streamlit and OpenCV. The toolkit demonstrates essential concepts of computer vision, including color space conversions, geometric transformations, filtering, morphological operations, image enhancement, edge detection, and compression. By combining theoretical notes with practical implementation, the project provides a strong foundation for understanding and applying core image processing techniques.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
